# mi-portafolio agent system

This repo's agent guidance lives in `.github/`, which Cursor doesn't load natively. Treat it as authoritative.

## Session start: maestro MCP first

The `maestro` MCP server (`.cursor/mcp.json` → `agent/1_interface/mcp_server.py`) reads `.github/agents/*.agent.md`, so it is the live bridge to every agent. At the start of every chat in this repo, before editing:

1. Call `maestro-context` (agents, workflows, key paths, `consistency_issues`).
2. Call `maestro-plan` with the workflow that matches the task (`ci`, `test`, `deploy`, `portfolio-update`, `quality`, `full-pipeline`).
3. Call `maestro-agent` with the owning agent (e.g. `portfolio-cv-manager` for CV work) and follow the returned instructions.
4. Use the listed `skill-*` tools, re-checking failed or suspiciously fast results with the native `pnpm` commands.

If the `maestro` tools are not available, tell the user to enable the server in Cursor Settings → MCP, then continue with the files below.

## Sources

1. `.github/copilot-instructions.md`: language (Spanish in chat, English in code/commits/branches), structure hygiene, security rules.
2. `.github/agents/agent-master-portfolio.agent.md`: act as the master orchestrator. Pick the specialist for the task and read its `.github/agents/<name>.agent.md` before acting.
3. `.github/instructions/*.instructions.md`: apply every file whose `applyTo` glob matches the files you touch:
   - `frontend-ui`: `apps/web/src/**` (Tailwind v4, routes `/` + `/demos`, ScrollToTop, naming)
   - `responsive-mobile`: components/CSS (360×780, skill cards, carousel)
   - `testing`: unit/E2E specs
   - `cv-management`, `deployment-cicd`: CV data and workflows
4. `.github/skills/*/SKILL.md` and `.github/prompts/*.prompt.md`: reusable workflows (e.g. `github-cli-automation` for branches/PRs).
5. `.github/agents/context/*.md`: grounding (monorepo map, OS known issues, testing matrix).

## Quick facts

- Repo `Harp-Andres/mi-portafolio` (renamed from `MiPortafolio`), Pages `https://harp-andres.github.io/mi-portafolio/`, Vite base `/mi-portafolio/`.
- Package manager `pnpm`; web package `@mportafolio/web`. Checks: `pnpm -F @mportafolio/web lint` and `pnpm -F @mportafolio/web test`.
- Windows + PowerShell: use `;` to chain commands and `--body-file` for `gh pr create`.

## Keep it current

When a task reveals a repeatable gotcha or convention, update the owning instructions, agent or context file in the same change (see "Auto-create skills" in the master agent).
